tags.description:
3GPP public carrier directory (`public_infos`). Read for any authenticated user;
create/update/delete under `/admin/public-infos` for **platform_admin** only.
Isolated from business `operators` / SIM flows (no FK).

enterpriseId.description:
Optional ENTERPRISE **`tenants.tenant_id`**. When set, must exist and its `parent_id` must match `resellerId`
(explicit or token-derived for reseller admin). Omit to bill all enterprises under the scoped reseller;
platform admin may omit both `resellerId` and `enterpriseId` to bill every enterprise in the system.
